.env.local

# The Dockerfile's `COPY . .` lands in the layer just before `npm run build`, so
# anything in the build context invalidates that layer — and the Vite build is the
# slowest step in bringing the harness stack up. None of the following is read by
# `tsc -b && vite build`, so keeping them out means editing a test (310 of them
# live under src/) no longer forces a full production rebuild here or a cold
# `type=gha` layer in cross-repo-verify.yml.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
e2e
playwright.config.ts
CHANGELOG.md
*.md
